--- text
Your card expires soon

The card on file for your [PRODUCT_NAME] subscription expires on
[CARD_EXPIRY]. Nothing has gone wrong: the subscription is active
and no payment has failed. This is a reminder to update the card
before the next charge.

Card on file

Card: [CARD_BRAND] ending [CARD_LAST4]
Expires: [CARD_EXPIRY]
Next charge: [NEXT_CHARGE_DATE] for [CURRENCY] [AMOUNT]

Update your card:

[CTA_URL]

If your bank has already replaced this card, there may be nothing
to do. Some banks send us the new details on their own. The card
above is the one we hold today, and the charge on
[NEXT_CHARGE_DATE] uses the card on file on that date.

If the charge on [NEXT_CHARGE_DATE] does not go through, your
account stays open. We will email you and try the card again on
[RETRY_DATE].

If anything here looks wrong, reply to this email, or write to
[SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
